{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll build a controller-first cave rescue game with a jetpack, laser, timed charges, and a complete rescue run. I’ll use local knowledge for the source and read the supplied AI Hub integration files directly, without web research.\n"}}
