{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"The first browser checks pass for physics and startup. The rendered cave also looks right in the compatibility renderer: inked silhouettes, work lights, mineral seams, and a readable HUD. Headless WebGPU reports a working renderer but produces blank screenshots here, so I’m using WebGL2 for visual checks and WebGPU for gameplay and integration tests.\n"}}
