{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"Testing found two issues to fix: a dropped charge could be nudged away from a wall by the pilot, and the fourth simultaneous headless race copy could fail during GPU startup. Charges now collide predictably with the cave, and I’m testing renderer recovery. I also corrected the steam vents so their red and blue states match the hazard cycle.\n"}}
